  "scope": "Exposed-cohort development repeat: every arm enables existing unique exact-search relocation for an otherwise invalid line anchor. Search/replacement text, digest, line-boundary and overlap checks remain unchanged. Original task inputs, model settings and arm order retained; new independent calls, no answer reuse. Every qualifying task from the fixed ten-task LRU roster, three independent draws each. Repetitions are not independent tasks. Three independent arms: direct strong, single cheap matching the cascade draft, and cheap plus at most one strong repair using only its own rejected proposal/public failure. Same original inputs in each round, hash-seeded arm order; no cross-round answers or labels. Full outcomes only after all calls. Strict original public/full counts and snapshots. Require aggregate AND each of three rounds to pass cost, latency and cheap-quality advantage gates; single repository, historical public data, no production claim. Stage cap $4 within cumulative $400; retain <=512files/64MiB. No new image or machine.",
